    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners OBrien Swaine are delighted to bring this beautifully presented three-bedroom detached home to the market, ideally located in a small, private development just moments from the Beach , offering the perfect blend of coastal living and everyday convenience. Situated within walking distance of Courtown Harbour and the infamous Courtown Woods, the property also enjoys close proximity to shops, cafes, and local amenities, with Ardamine Beach just across the road. Communal Tennis Court, Boules Court , Exercise Machines , Doggie Exercise Area in the Development only for the Residents Inside, the home features a bright and modern open-plan kitchen, dining, and sitting area, Fitted Kitchen Units and a Wood Burning Stove —an inviting space ideal for both relaxing and entertaining. A small utility room provides additional practicality, while a generously sized ground-floor bedroom with its own ensuite offers flexible living options, perfect for guests or single-level living. Upstairs, there are two well-proportioned bedrooms, both complete with built-in wardrobes, along with a stylish family Shower Room serving this level. To the rear, the property boasts a sunny south-facing garden, ideal for enjoying outdoor dining and long summer evenings. The garden also includes a durable Adman steel shed for extra storage. There are two side entrances—one covered for added convenience, and the other providing wide access. This home is a fantastic opportunity for anyone seeking a peaceful coastal lifestyle within easy reach of all local amenities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Oil Fired Central Heating White goods included - Oven & Hob, Dishwasher ,Fridge Freezer Blinds and Light Fittings included South Facng Back Garden Large Patio and Lawned Area Walled Rear Garden Adman Shed 1 Side Entrance covered with concrete floor Not overlooked Granite Parking Area to Front Granite Patio area in rear Garden Outside Tap Management Fee € 560 per annum Communal Tennis Court, Boules Court, and Exercise Machines in the Development"
      },
